uts a structured table.\n\n### Python Code:\n```python\nimport math\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Generate the first 200 digits of Pi (excluding the integer part)\npi_str = str(math.pi)[2:202]\n\n# Create index values\nindex = list(range(len(pi_str) // 6))  # Adjust grouping if needed\n\n# Split into headers and data bytes\nheaders = [int(pi_str[i * 6 : i * 6 + 2]) for i in range(len(index))]\ndata_bytes = [int(pi_str[i * 6 + 2 : i * 6 + 6]) for i in range(len(index))]\n\n# Create DataFrame\ndf = pd.DataFrame({\"Index\": index, \"Header\": headers, \"Data Byte\": data_bytes})\n\n# Display\nimport ace_tools as tools\ntools.display_dataframe_to_user(name=\"Pi Data Table\", dataframe=df)\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n1. Extracts the first **200 decimal digits** of π.\n2. Groups them into **headers** (2-digit segments) and **data bytes** (4-digit segments).\n3. Generates a table similar to your provided image.\n\nLet me know if you need modifications! 🚀"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[],"content_references":[],"message_type":null,"model_slug":"gpt-4o","default_model_slug":"gpt-4o","parent_id":"1ef0c490-e04d-4ed9-90fc-fbfb6ae3fd39","request_id":"910cbce4ce68a94e-DTW","timestamp_":"absolute","model_switcher_deny":[]},"recipient":"all","channel":null},"parent":"1ef0c490-e04d-4ed9-90fc-fbfb6ae3fd39","children":["14755903-78e4-48e7-8941-b45e6c151848"]},"14755903-78e4-48e7-8941-b45e6c151848":{"id":"14755903-78e4-48e7-8941-b45e6c151848","message":{"id":"14755903-78e4-48e7-8941-b45e6c151848","author":{"role":"user","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1739365124.856521,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["how about no ace_tools and it's 2 bits then 6 for a total of 8 each line....."]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1,"metadata":{"serialization_metadata":{"custom_symbol_offsets":[]},"dictation":false,"r